    84	### 2. Six closed driver identities
    85	
    86	The driver identifier space is closed by enumeration, never by grammar,
    87	detection, or a family prefix. Protocol 1.0 admits exactly these values and
    88	rejects every other:
    89	
    90	| Driver | Language family | Source mode | Receipt schema | Status |
