   100	
   101	The identifier form is `<family>-v<n>` for the local source mode and
   102	`<family>-repository-v<n>` for the external source mode, matching the deployed
   103	Go pair. The Kotlin family segment carries the `native` backend qualifier
   104	because Kotlin has two candidate backends and only the native one can satisfy
